{"accountName": "火绒安全实验室", "author": "火绒安全实验室", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "原创 火绒安全 2026-11-23 17:00 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "假外挂真窃密丨借《逃离塔科夫》Loader 投放的反射注入木马分析", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/u1Oy5xQ01SrEAUGUSphUxmtoBFNyut0U78Qg6b29icSA5Fv1GkWcwhth5vmH6UcBCgUY2v8EhRRMfILXLhEOIAk2PfVtUjrjeRX5UU0mXK80/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "0 1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "概述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "近期， 火绒安全实验室监测到GitLab平台上出现伪装成《逃离塔科夫》游戏外挂的恶意样本。 该项目宣称具备自瞄、透视、雷达等功能，实际为窃密木马，运行后会窃取浏览器敏感信息、加密货币钱包、即时通讯数据等，并通过Telegram频道描述获取C2地址上传数据。除此以外，该木马还会采集Claude Code、Codex CLI、等AI开发工具的本地配置，以及OneNote等笔记软件数据以及相关VPN工具的连接信息——在 AI工具深度接入工作流的当下，这些配置中保存的API密钥一旦泄露，波及的不只是个人隐私，还会有企业账户与算力资产。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01Spudllvu70hLibXobia2qoF87oc0SicnUezK7hcN8u0opYNrFoSA8y1SLdQcoqGfQYAZ63iaTWWUFkAHvF1IGPFWKD03Wd5CWnWIsc/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "火绒工程师在溯源中发现 ，该项目创建于2026年11月15日，仓库仅包含eft_hack.zip与README，无真实外挂源码。从时间线看，本次追踪到的载荷托管仓库（skywatch）创建于2026年10月19日，比该诱饵仓库早了将近一个月——也就是说，早在诱饵抛出之前，载荷分发通道就已经就绪。这更像是一场有准备的行动，而非临时起意。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "仓库", "type": "p"}, {"text": "README中直接宣称：“我们制作的《逃离塔科夫》外挂，配备了目前市面上最好的塔科夫自动瞄准、透视/穿墙功能。我们的外挂功能非常强大，我们力求始终保持领先优势。在这里，我们成就胜利。”并给出了使用说明。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 3, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01SpWFqfccNFXNwmkJtN57QLnoEI5YrDs40utVO61OKpdqYzu8jtfFRBMu6OqicFwksEbOXq00uooibV5BJoztCjbaLsBTR3530OpE/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "README", "type": "p"}, {"text": "火绒安全实验室 将持续关注此类窃密木马的传播动态，并及时更新拦截规则，保障用户系统安全。目前， 火绒安全产品已实现对该行为的拦截与查杀 。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "查杀图", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 4, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01So4HMiaY3Ricw7vtF5NVqMVQbeXiaOuxR9ASbvRFajmibmKhbKVcibLn5yX6ocZJckvjsbWwapI92nTp2rm19icQOeloPBAlEtIV4QPE/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "0 2", "type": "p"}, {"text": "流程图", "type": "p"}, {"text": "流程图", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 5, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01Sr5qdzZg3asd0NjictS8JHWobM76GHhbia54yGaLAtzDry08iakzt6tKfzdFBD3KQYPtkIHYSGRG4wXIYzyt3icrsJUiaLY7qavxgZw/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "0 3", "type": "p"}, {"text": "样本分析", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Loader程序启动后首先显示更新提示，通过PowerShell弹出Checking for updates提示信息，随后向Pastebin发起HTTP GET请求，获取远程配置。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 6, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01SoxmuqB2FTvmct3go8vdO7ANNBgibdZ1KibE8C6s0ibR2jU0gCnoZXLqJA6DrySbHvlPqxJvTUibPs9bb3ib8Xic1kH3HEV99F1G3bib0/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "弹出Checking for updates、获取远程配置", "type": "p"}, {"text": "解析配置后，生成随机字符串，构造随机目录名。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "读取响应，生成随机字符串", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01SrwGyl2dGCvoRPEgNS8ibMtyJhhJMy8YZY0GFWhnCEdFQfF5WBWTyFAslRIpbR8rBHZiatkeIPWCMuQe1tibLib2pC9uPIhOGZPVK0/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "遍历配置，下载文件。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "每行作为一个待处理项目", "type": "p"}, {"text": "通过exec_Command()和Cmd_Start()启动下载的程序，将执行流程交给下一阶段。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/u1Oy5xQ01SpQxl6Hiah3GVq8IzwSrZ0v7c4wMml3hHr3cibU9Rv5RmKEj4aP701yX9lZTjyXpOnOq4wWmBCmWlxeb8ke1O5vP0u13ULPbIwKQ/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "启动下载的程序", "type": "p"}, {"text": "本次分析中发现的下载地址：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://gitlab.com/charlyhills/skywatch/-/raw/main/74L814BW31FX.exe", "type": "quote"}, {"text": "该项目创建于2026年10月19日，同样无正常代码，仓库内连续提交多个随机命名PE文件：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "skywatch项目主页", "type": "p"}, {"text": "第二阶段程序启动后，首先初始化所需模块和API函数地址。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "API初始化与导出函数检查", "type": "p"}, {"text": "解析PE节表，定位NT Headers，获取节数量以及Section Table地址。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PE节表扫描与特征匹配", "type": "p"}, {"text": "初始化解密数据缓冲区，分配工作缓冲区，并将内置数据复制到新分配的内存中。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "解密数据及密码状态初始化", "type": "p"}, {"text": "根据CPU特征选择数据处理路径，一条路径使用SIMD优化实现，另一条路径使用普通实现。两条路径最终生成后续解密流程所需的数据状态。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "两条数据处理分支", "type": "p"}, {"text": "验证解密后的PE文件，检查DOS Header的MZ签名、e_lfanew范围，以及NT Headers的PE签名。验证失败则进入清理及终止流程。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PE文件格式验证", "type": "p"}, {"text": "解析CreateThread/WaitForSingleObject地址，创建线程执行。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "创建线程执行", "type": "p"}, {"text": "解密字符串，解析ntdll导出，建立syscall描述表。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "解析ntdll导出", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Patch EtwEventWrite。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "patch API", "type": "p"}, {"text": "根据内置浏览器路径表查找本机安装的浏览器，对于Microsoft Edge，程序会修改注册表位置，关闭Edge Startup Boost，中止目标浏览器现有进程，创建挂起浏览器进程并注入DLL。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "创建挂起进程注入", "type": "p"}, {"text": "被注入的DLL通过导出函数KdMXFBaWQ作为反射式加载入口，将DLL自身映射到新的内存区域，映射完成后，调用DLL入口点，获取当前进程命令行， 检查是否包含--incognito参数。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "映射后调用", "type": "p"}, {"text": "根据宿主浏览器类型选择不同的数据采集路径。按宿主类型拼出浏览器的User Data目录，再拼出Local State的完整路径，Chromium家族进入浏览器数据采集流程。Firefox / Zen 进入Gecko对应分支。--incognito参数决定是否执行全量采集。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Chromium分支提取密码、Cookie、银行卡、自动填充、CVC、Token和历史记录。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "数据", "type": "p"}, {"text": "库文件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "读取字段", "type": "p"}, {"text": "上报元素", "type": "p"}, {"text": "账号密码", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Login Data", "type": "p"}, {"text": "logins", "type": "p"}, {"text": "origin_url、username_value、password_value", "type": "p"}, {"text": "769", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Cookie", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Network\\Cookies", "type": "p"}, {"text": "cookies", "type": "p"}, {"text": "host_key、name、path、is_secure、expires_utc、encrypted_value", "type": "p"}, {"text": "770", "type": "p"}, {"text": "银行卡", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Web Data", "type": "p"}, {"text": "credit_cards", "type": "p"}, {"text": "guid、name_on_card、expiration_month、expiration_year、card_number_encrypted", "type": "p"}, {"text": "771", "type": "p"}, {"text": "自动填充", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Web Data", "type": "p"}, {"text": "autofill", "type": "p"}, {"text": "name、value", "type": "p"}, {"text": "772", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVC/支付令牌", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Web Data", "type": "p"}, {"text": "local_stored_cvc、token_service", "type": "p"}, {"text": "guid、value_encrypted/service、encrypted_token", "type": "p"}, {"text": "773", "type": "p"}, {"text": "历史记录", "type": "p"}, {"text": "History", "type": "p"}, {"text": "urls", "type": "p"}, {"text": "url、title", "type": "p"}, {"text": "774", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Gecko分支通过NSS解密Firefox/Zen保存的登录凭据。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "数据", "type": "p"}, {"text": "文件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "保存的登录账号与密码", "type": "p"}, {"text": "logins.json", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Cookie", "type": "p"}, {"text": "cookies.sqlite", "type": "p"}, {"text": "浏览历史", "type": "p"}, {"text": "places.sqlite", "type": "p"}, {"text": "主密码与密钥材料", "type": "p"}, {"text": "key4.db", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其他模块：采集钱包、浏览器扩展、Discord、Steam、Roblox、Telegram、Signal等数据。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "模块", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目标", "type": "p"}, {"text": "路径 / 注册表", "type": "p"}, {"text": "桌面钱包", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Bitcoin Core、Monero、Litecoin、Dash、NEM", "type": "p"}, {"text": "wallet.dat、monero-core\\wallet_path", "type": "p"}, {"text": "扩展钱包", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Phantom、Solflare、Keplr、Ronin", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Local Extension Settings、Sync Extension Settings、moz-extension+++", "type": "p"}, {"text": "笔记", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Notion、OneNote、Evernote、Obsidian", "type": "p"}, {"text": "\\Notion、Microsoft\\OneNote、conduit-storage、obsidian\\IndexedDB", "type": "p"}, {"text": "VPN", "type": "p"}, {"text": "NordVPN、OpenVPN、PIA、ProtonVPN", "type": "p"}, {"text": "\\NordVPN、.ovpn、pia_manager、\\ProtonVPN", "type": "p"}, {"text": "FTP", "type": "p"}, {"text": "WinSCP、FileZilla、CoreFTP", "type": "p"}, {"text": "注册表 WinSCP 2\\Sessions；recentservers.xml、sitemanager.xml、Credentials.txt", "type": "p"}, {"text": "即时通信", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Telegram、Signal、Discord", "type": "p"}, {"text": "tdata、Signal\\config.json+db.sqlite、Discord\\Local Storage\\leveldb", "type": "p"}, {"text": "游戏", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Steam、Roblox", "type": "p"}, {"text": "ssfn*、loginusers.vdf、RobloxCookies.dat", "type": "p"}, {"text": "开发工具", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Claude Code、Codex CLI、Copilot、Cursor、Continue、JetBrains", "type": "p"}, {"text": "AppData\\Roaming\\Cursor\\User\\globalStorage\\state.vscdb、JetBrains\\*\\options\\ai.assistant.xml、Claude Code / Codex CLI / Copilot / Continue / tabby 配置目录", "type": "p"}, {"text": "文件采集", "type": "p"}, {"text": "密钥/钱包类文件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "文件名含 pem、seed、wallet、privatekey", "type": "p"}, {"text": "屏幕与主机", "type": "p"}, {"text": "桌面、用户名、系统信息", "type": "p"}, {"text": "GDI 抓屏 + GetUserNameW", "type": "p"}, {"text": "从Telegram频道描述获取C2地址。失败时使用硬编码地址作为备用。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "打包上传C2", "type": "p"}, {"text": "当前TG频道的值为super-fourteen33.cc。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "TG描述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0 4", "type": "p"}, {"text": "火绒安全建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "✔✔ 不要下载、解压、运行任何免费/免检测外挂，尤其GitLab、GitHub话题页引流的压缩包；", "type": "p"}, {"text": "✔✔ 开启火绒实时防护与主动防御；", "type": "p"}, {"text": "✔✔ 对已运行过诱饵机的用户，加密货币钱包、密码管理器主密码、2FA恢复码全部轮换，并审查Obsidian/AI工具配置是否被外泄。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0 5", "type": "p"}, {"text": "样本IOC", "type": "p"}, {"text": "文件名", "type": "p"}, {"text": "SHA256", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Loader.exe", "type": "p"}, {"text": "6C2446F06869A50DF82165DBBC78527186CC70E8EBB50C48634DE0AB9057C00A", "type": "p"}, {"text": "74L814BW31FX.exe", "type": "p"}, {"text": "057CD337D7C3F70E1C6DD516E7D475986ECF90E97A4D1B2635CD68146BC5104C", "type": "p"}, {"text": "74L814BW31FX_inner.exe", "type": "p"}, {"text": "C8EB508CD44B50777395912048947E0D6712B8D2767E3640E7DDFE5FA52A8636", "type": "p"}, {"text": "74L81_spy.dll", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1B6D0998D616187435F7C57D8DB13B1FE50081204FD874FD468946AC2DA64ADA", "type": "p"}, {"text": "OV3752WCW41D.exe", "type": "p"}, {"text": "BEC394F9B5883911989219BF7E2B5077F79E89A35ED4C6F056EA9DC5D99EEEDA", "type": "p"}, {"text": "OV3752_spy.dll", "type": "p"}, {"text": "22A5808BD68302B01837C6A4C689A1B5512C56994AB7DA307EAE74296AF4BB41", "type": "p"}, {"text": "TNG90Z66QII7.exe", "type": "p"}, {"text": "87CEDE9685DA954E44918A54D78B9FB1CA0C459E6553B6A3B49A23C9E971FE92", "type": "p"}, {"text": "TNG90_inner.exe", "type": "p"}, {"text": "68A627B15B4CE817B5169CAC324DB124502475F2ACE04D118870A3EDA25476FB", "type": "p"}, {"text": "TNG90_spy.dll", "type": "p"}, {"text": "01550A72FE23614F6DC8C67A6A13D93E6B355C5CEAAFB7D1D5CE7D988E25A518", "type": "p"}, {"text": "C2", "type": "p"}, {"text": "seall-vernous.com", "type": "p"}, {"text": "super-fourteen33.cc", "type": "p"}, {"text": "仓库地址", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://gitlab.com/strikecastle/escape-from-tarkov-cheat-undetected-with-aimbot-esp-wallhack-radar-hack-and-more/", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://gitlab.com/charlyhills/skywatch/", "type": "p"}, {"text": "关于火绒", "type": "p"}, {"text": "火绒安全成立于2011年，是一家专注、纯粹的安全公司，致力于在终端安全领域为用户提供专业的产品和专注的服务，并持续对外赋能反病毒引擎等相关自主研发技术。多年来，火绒安全产品凭借“专业、干净、轻巧”的特点收获了广大用户的良好口碑。火绒企业版产品更是针对企业内外网脆弱的环节，拓展了企业对于终端管理的范围和方式，提升了产品的兼容性、易用性，最终实现更直观的将威胁可视化、让管理轻便化，充分达到保护企业信息安全的目的。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点点赞", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点分享", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点喜欢", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/u1Oy5xQ01SrEAUGUSphUxmtoBFNyut0U78Qg6b29icSA5Fv1GkWcwhth5vmH6UcBCgUY2v8EhRRMfILXLhEOIAk2PfVtUjrjeRX5UU0mXK80/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "11月23日", "id": "1469605664", "summary": "原创 火绒安全 2026-11-23 17:00 北京 \n假外挂真窃密丨借《逃离塔科夫》Loader 投放的反射注入木马分析\n0 1 \n概述 \n近期， 火绒安全实验室监测到GitLab平台上出现伪装成《逃离塔科夫》游戏外挂的恶意样本。 该项目宣称具备自瞄、透视、雷达等功能，实际为窃密木马，运行后会窃取浏览器敏感信息、加密货币钱包、即时通讯数据等，并通过Telegram频道描述获取C2地址上传数据。", "title": "假外挂真窃密丨借《逃离塔科夫》Loader投放的反射注入木马分析", "ts": 1795424400000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3NjYzMDM1Mg==&mid=2247539006&idx=1&sn=c6c9fbcaeaf2490de4feac11cbee2580"}